d Dots tile that breaks the potential Full Flush pattern (24 points) I can achieve with all Bamboo tiles. With only 1 B5 unshown and no support tiles in hand, it's a dead tile. Discarding it allows me to focus on forming chows with my strong T2-T7 sequence, aiming for Full Flush plus additional chow-based patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play B5"}
